WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:02.360
You and I will go to the north

00:02.440 --> 00:03.200
With a unit

00:03.320 --> 00:04.480
Act flexibly

00:04.560 --> 00:05.240
Let's go

00:05.320 --> 00:06.400
I accept the order

00:07.500 --> 00:15.000
Even with the volunteer army joining, you could barely muster five thousand men. You committed everyone you could mobilize to the defense of the North City.

00:15.500 --> 00:22.500
Yet while fighting raged at the North City, commotion suddenly broke out inside the walls. Next came soaring flames from the south—everyone realized that the rear granary had been set ablaze by the Wunu.

00:23.000 --> 00:30.000
The defenders' morale plummeted instantly and routed into chaos, while the sight of the blazing granary spurred the Wunu forces to ferocious heights. In less than two hours, Shi Lang's host swept through the defenses like dead branches, completely breaking Yiyang.

00:30.500 --> 00:36.500
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao fought to the death without retreating. Moved by his fierce valor, Shi Lang severed his head and fashioned it into a wine goblet, keeping it as an enduring tribute.
